# J144: does night 1's colour-count pattern hold on fresh seeds? (night 2 (J144, seeds 1501-1504))

Every rate is "in a random deck of this makeup", as Forge's Default AI plays it (D447 point 10). Pre-registered (D447 point 9; the job file, before any night-2 game): a candidate HOLDS in a band when night 2's 95% deck-clustered bootstrap interval excludes the null in night 1's direction, else NOT SHOWN. No pooling with night 1 for the verdict; the pooled column is information only. cards.tsv is reported, not confirmed.

**12 of 12 hold**: (i) in 4 of 4 bands, (ii) in 4 of 4 bands, (iii) in 4 of 4 bands.

